   "id": "snoop-dotson-arrival",
   "kind": "chapter",
   "club": "Eagles",
   "headline": "A Young Linebacker Walks Into a Champion's Locker Room in Philadelphia",
   "body": [
    "Dorren Skura's first Eagles club had just won Super Bowl CXLVII when Snoop Dotson made the roster for Y89, at 23. The defense he joined was already good. It got better. Philadelphia went 14-2-1 and beat the Bengals 44-14 in Super Bowl CXLVIII, and the linebacker finished his first recorded season with a ring and 59 tackles across 20 games.",
    "The market was not impressed yet. His card opened at a value of 12 with an overall rating of 66, the profile of a depth player. The skill grade told a different story, an A minus already, a hint that the tape was running ahead of the ratings. Nobody in that locker room could have guessed that the linebacker would outlast nearly all of it."
   ],
